#: src/paperphone/pdf_output.py:107
msgid ""
"If the optional map page is printed on the reverse, lay it map-side up and "
"fold in half so the two circles touch. Fold in half again so the squares "
"touch, then fold in half one last time. Without a map page, use the main-"
"page fold marks and check the cover orientation. If using the card guides, "
"carefully cut along the dotted diagonal lines to hold a contactless card."
